{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing profile standing on a small patch of pebbly ground against a plain off-white background. It has the overall body shape, proportions and posture of a horse, with a long neck, deep chest, and four sturdy legs. The head, neck, shoulders, upper forelegs, hindquarters, lower legs and tail are covered in short to medium-length shaggy brown fur with darker shading on the lower legs and a lighter muzzle. The central trunk from just behind the shoulders across the back, sides and belly to the front of the hind legs is covered in a contrasting mottled skin of blue-grey, dark brown and creamy off-white, densely set with numerous raised rounded bumps of varying size in white, cream and dark grey. The animal stands squarely with all four feet on the ground, head held slightly forward, ears upright.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated horse-like head with a long muzzle, dark eye in profile, visible nostril and closed mouth with lips and chin fur",
      "where": "at the anterior end of the neck, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two pointed, upright, furry brown ears with inner ear detail",
      "where": "on top of the head, one slightly behind the other in profile"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, thick, shaggy brown hair with a slightly wavy, unkempt texture",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four sturdy, columnar, furry brown legs with visible joints, darker brown shading and lighter hair around the lower leg",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the rump, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "solid, rounded, light brown hooves with a darker edge and slight shadow underneath",
      "where": "at the distal tip of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick, hairy brown tail with coarse, hanging hair",
      "where": "at the posterior end of the body, attached at the rump and hanging down behind the hind legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "extensive mottled patch of blue-grey, dark brown-black and creamy white with dense, raised, circular wart or barnacle-like bumps of various sizes in white, cream and dark grey, with a bumpy, textured surface distinct from the surrounding brown fur",
      "where": "covering the dorsal mid-back, lateral sides and ventral belly from behind the shoulders to the front of the hind legs, including the top of the rump and the lower belly, bordered by brown fur on the neck, shoulders, hindquarters and legs"
    }
  ],
